OL,3,GNEWSA'Striking absence of public
OL,4,Aaccountability' over BBC NI cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC Northern Ireland has shown a
OL,7,F"striking absence of public
OL,8,Faccountability" over planned cuts to
OL,9,Fprogrammes and services, Stormont's
OL,10,Fleader of the opposition has said.
OL,12,FSocial Democratic and Labour Party
OL,13,F(SDLP) assembly member Matthew O'Toole
OL,14,Fwas speaking during a Stormont debate
OL,15,Fwhich raised concerns over the
OL,16,Fproposals.
OL,18,FSome shows in Northern Ireland have
OL,19,Fbeen axed and services scaled back as
OL,20,Fpart of the corporation targeting #500m
OL,21,Fof savings in two years.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
