OL,3,GNEWSA'Striking absence of public
OL,4,Aaccountability' over BBC NI cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA BBC spokesperson said the "challenges
OL,7,Fthat we face are significant, but our
OL,8,Faim will be to protect the quality and
OL,9,Fdistinctiveness of what we do".
